## Installation

From the Helm repository:

```bash
helm repo add rgielen https://rgielen.github.io/charts
helm repo update
helm install my-{{ template "chart.name" . }} rgielen/{{ template "chart.name" . }} --version {{ template "chart.version" . }}
```

Or directly from the OCI registry:

```bash
helm install my-{{ template "chart.name" . }} oci://ghcr.io/rgielen/charts/{{ template "chart.name" . }} --version {{ template "chart.version" . }}
```

